/bench/repo/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-02-transcription-settings.md:Note: `request.GetConfig().GetModel()` requires that the API-level `TranscriptionConfig` actually have a `model` field. The current proto only has `prompt` and `language`. We don't add a model override field at this step — the `GetModel()` accessor will not exist. Remove the model-override line entirely so the precedence is **persisted setting → engine default**, with no per-call override:
/bench/repo/docs/superpowers/plans/2026-05-02-transcription-settings.md:this precedence: per-call request → persisted transcription config
